@startuml
title SD01 Complaint Submission and Severity Routing
actor Student
boundary "Browser" as UI
control "Flask API and AuthService" as API
control ComplaintService as C
control RoutingPolicy as R
database "SQLite Repository" as DB
Student -> UI: Submit complaint
UI -> API: POST /api/v1/complaints
API -> API: Validate session, Student role, CSRF and fields
break Invalid session or input
API --> UI: 401 / 403 / 422, no writes
end
API -> C: submitComplaint(actor, input)
C -> R: initialLevel(severity)
alt Low or Medium
R --> C: L1 Faculty-in-Charge
else High
R --> C: L2 Grievance Committee
end
critical One SQLite transaction
C -> DB: Create complaint and assignment history
C -> DB: Append SUBMIT and ASSIGN audit entries
Create in-app assignment notification
DB --> C: Transaction result, commit or error
end
break Persistence failure
DB --> C: ROLLBACK and database error
C --> API: 503, no success confirmation
API --> UI: 503, no success confirmation
end
C --> API: Persisted complaint representation
API --> UI: 201 Created and Location
UI --> Student: Complaint confirmation
@enduml
